1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,441
Korea outlawed shamanism

2
00:00:02,441 --> 00:00:04,781
for five hundred years.

3
00:00:04,781 --> 00:00:06,409
It never worked.

4
00:00:06,409 --> 00:00:07,950
The law said shamans could

5
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,547
So who kept visiting them?

6
00:00:14,547 --> 00:00:16,887
The wives of the elite.

7
00:00:16,887 --> 00:00:18,921
In secret. At night.

8
00:00:18,921 --> 00:00:21,566
Because they weren't going

9
00:00:21,566 --> 00:00:23,296
for superstition.

10
00:00:23,296 --> 00:00:25,941
They were going for a sick

11
00:00:25,941 --> 00:00:28,484
child. A difficult birth.

12
00:00:28,484 --> 00:00:29,908
A dead parent.

13
00:00:29,908 --> 00:00:31,841
The state had laws.

14
00:00:31,841 --> 00:00:34,486
The shamans had an answer.

15
00:00:34,486 --> 00:00:37,131
You can outlaw a practice.

16
00:00:37,131 --> 00:00:39,572
You cannot outlaw grief.

17
00:00:39,572 --> 00:00:41,810
The records are on the

18
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:42,624
channel.
